{"id":"P086-2","subject":"P","unit":"P086","unitTitle":"2025 ② (5월~8월) · 25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P086-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n단상 승압용 변압기의 1차측 전압이 110V, 2차측 전압\n\n이 220V일 때, 부하에 1000VA를 공급하기 위한 자\n\n기용량VA 은?\n\n\n① 2000         ② 1500\n\n③ 1000         ④ 500","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2025p2-e08-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m26-q.webp","width":678,"height":483},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m26-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1066}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P086-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n3상 유도기를 발전기로 사용하는 경우의 슬립 범위는?\n\n\n①          ② \n\n③        ④ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2025p2-e08-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m27-q.webp","width":678,"height":404},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m27-e1.webp","width":678,"height":793}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P086-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n3상 4극 50Hz 유도전동기 정격 회전속도가 1410rpm\n\n일 때, 회전자 주파수Hz는?\n\n\n① 12          ② 10\n\n③ 6           ④ 3","source":{"coll